{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PDF Ultra 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的 PDF 閱讀器，內建離線朗讀、全文搜尋與手寫標註功能，適合需要研讀教材、審閱報告或免手操作收聽長篇文件的人士。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，所有檔案留存在裝置上，無廣告亦毋須建立帳戶。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/ae/00/3f/ae003f4a-cd99-3165-2ce0-5eda577fe1f8/Placeholder.mill/460x460Icon.ApSiOS01-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/ae/00/3f/ae003f4a-cd99-3165-2ce0-5eda577fe1f8/Placeholder.mill/460x460Icon.ApSiOS01-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/></p>\n<h2>離線朗讀與手寫標註</h2>\n<p>PDF Ultra 提供日間、夜間與復古色模式，支援連續或單頁閱讀、縮放及自動捲動。朗讀功能具自然語音、背景播放、跟讀高亮與速度調整，鎖屏後仍可控制。它亦支援全文搜尋、手寫標註、書籤及開啟受密碼保護的 PDF，所有檔案完全離線處理。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-249-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-250-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-251-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-252-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-253-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-254-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PDF Ultra: PDF Reader &amp; Voice</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pdf-ultra-pdf-reader-voice/id6794345479?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:16:14.356863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T15:06:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:57:07.082664+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:09:46.293138+00:00","content_hash":"b30fd02504fc0dcbb2e8af0c9870e5aa5c1fbe26a4620f0220618a8493cab585","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}